COMMENT ON TABLE public.support_tickets IS 'Deliberately has NO foreign key into payments, payouts, fees or the ledger. That is the structural expression of CANONICAL.md section 2: the support role can read all records and cannot move money. A table it cannot reach is an operation it cannot perform.';


